<title>USA: American says Boeing aircraft delayed.</title>
<headline>American says Boeing aircraft delayed.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMR Corp is unable to take delivery on at least 14 Boeing Co aircraft scheduled for 1998 because of delays caused by the recent labor dispute at American Airlines, AMR said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Chief Financial Officer Gerard Arpey said the contract dispute with pilots prevented American from putting in firm purchase orders as planned early this year so Boeing sold many of the delivery positions it had slated for American.</p>
</text>
